{%- comment -%}
  The header menu for the toneScan landing pages: "Label|#section-id" pairs, comma separated,
  printed for the current template (nothing on other templates). Read by sections/header.liquid
  to build the menu, and by layout/tonescan.liquid to hide, from the first paint, links whose
  section is not on the page (hidden in the editor, or cut from the lite page).
  Usage: {%- capture links -%}{% render 'ts-landing-links' %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if template.suffix == 'tonelight-ks-promo' -%}
The system|#how-it-works,Features|#features,Why RGB|#compare,Rewards|#rewards,Timeline|#timeline,About us|#team,Specs|#specs,FAQ|#faq
{%- elsif template.suffix == 'tonescan' or template.suffix == 'tonescan-lite' -%}
Features|#features,How it works|#how-it-works,Pricing|#pricing,FAQ|#faq
{%- endif -%}
